		<pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2009 03:53:59 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=390#comment-2197</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Muid was a flowing river of nature-love. He walked in harmony with the earth and transmitted that peace with his very breath, and yet he was humble as dirt. I am so glad to have known him.

Al hum d&#039;lillah]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Muid was a flowing river of nature-love. He walked in harmony with the earth and transmitted that peace with his very breath, and yet he was humble as dirt. I am so glad to have known him.</p>
<p>Al hum d&#8217;lillah</p>
]]></content:encoded>
